  "releaseNotes": "Vitraux 1.2.5-rc\n\t\t- Updated to .Net 10.0.\n\t\t- Added the new Actions system for declarative ViewModel method binding.\n\t\t\t- Supports sync and async actions.\n\t\t\t- Supports parameterized actions via custom binders.\n\t\t\t- Generates efficient auto-registered JS event handlers.\n\t\t- Improved JS generation pipeline for better performance.\n\t\t- Internal refactoring and code cleanup for stability and maintainability.\n\t\t- Updated reference manual and developer documentation.\n\n\t\tThis is a release candidate for 1.2.5. API is considered stable for production testing.",
